{
  "_doc": "Camera presets for the 2.5D layered camera (pipeline/src/lib/camera.mjs). Keys use u = 0..1 across [start, end] of the scene (or `duration` seconds when set). dx/dy are world-unit offsets from the scene anchor (scaled by `amount`); zoom (lens, no parallax) and dolly (camera travel, parallax by layer depth) are multipliers. One main camera move per shot (Camera Guide §7).",
